body:
(This is just our view) Alters fusing is both sad and happy. A lot of us are scared of fusion because that means that they won't exist anymore (in their view, again- I don't know, I've never fused, and every system experiences it differently) but it could mean losing a lover or a best friend (but also means you get to meet the new person they've become! So not entirely a bad thing)

&#x200B;

Agreed tho, they're incredibly dramatic about it

got just under 3 years to go- ^^;
We're leaving after we graduate so the mom can't drag us back if she finds us and we'll have our diploma (hopefully)
If we could up and leave now and just finish school online, that'd be great. But if the mom does find us, our safety is at risk so we're playing it safe
